export const CATEGORIES = {motion:'运动',looks:'外观',sound:'声音',events:'事件',control:'控制',sensing:'检测',operators:'运算',variables:'变量',custom:'自制积木',pen:'画笔'};
export const numberField=(label,value,min=-1000000,max=1000000)=>({kind:'number',label,default:value,min,max,expression:true});
const valueField=(label,value)=>({kind:'value',label,default:value,expression:true});
const choice=(label,value,options)=>({kind:'choice',label,default:value,options});
const nameField=(label,value,kind='name')=>({kind,label,default:value});
export const TYPES={};
function define(type,category,label,fields={},extra={}){TYPES[type]={category,label,fields,...extra};}
const n=numberField,v=valueField;
define('move','motion','移动',{value:n('步数',60,-480,480)},{unit:'步'});
define('turn','motion','右转',{value:n('角度',90,-360,360)},{unit:'度'});
define('goto','motion','移到',{x:n('X',0,-240,240),y:n('Y',0,-180,180)});
define('changeX','motion','X 增加',{value:n('增加量',10,-480,480)});
define('changeY','motion','Y 增加',{value:n('增加量',10,-360,360)});
define('setX','motion','X 设为',{value:n('X',0,-240,240)});
define('setY','motion','Y 设为',{value:n('Y',0,-180,180)});
define('point','motion','面向方向',{value:n('角度',0,-360,360)});
define('glide','motion','滑行到',{x:n('X',100,-240,240),y:n('Y',0,-180,180),seconds:n('秒数',1,0,10)});
define('bounce','motion','碰到边缘就反弹');
define('say','looks','说',{value:v('内容','你好，世界！')});
define('think','looks','想',{value:v('内容','让我想一想…')});
define('show','looks','显示角色');define('hide','looks','隐藏角色');
define('setSize','looks','大小设为',{value:n('百分比',100,10,300)});
define('changeSize','looks','大小增加',{value:n('增加量',10,-300,300)});
define('nextCostume','looks','下一个造型');
define('backdrop','looks','切换背景',{value:choice('背景','space',['meadow','space','paper'])});
define('note','sound','播放音符',{value:n('音符 MIDI',60,24,96),seconds:n('秒数',0.3,0.05,5)});
define('setVolume','sound','音量设为',{value:n('百分比',80,0,100)});
define('changeVolume','sound','音量增加',{value:n('增加量',-10,-100,100)});
define('stopSound','sound','停止所有声音');
define('whenFlag','events','当绿旗被点击',{}, {container:true,event:true});
define('whenKey','events','当按下键',{key:choice('按键','space',['space','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','ArrowUp','ArrowDown','a','d','w','s'])},{container:true,event:true});
define('whenClick','events','当角色被点击',{}, {container:true,event:true});
define('whenMessage','events','当收到广播',{name:nameField('消息','开始')},{container:true,event:true});
define('broadcast','events','广播',{name:nameField('消息','开始')});
define('wait','control','等待',{value:n('秒数',0.5,0,10)},{unit:'秒'});
define('repeat','control','重复执行',{value:n('次数',4,0,100)},{container:true,unit:'次'});
define('forever','control','一直重复',{}, {container:true});
define('if','control','如果',{condition:v('条件',{type:'touchingEdge'})},{container:true,otherwise:true});
define('until','control','重复直到',{condition:v('条件',{type:'touchingEdge'})},{container:true});
define('stopScript','control','停止此脚本');
define('resetTimer','sensing','计时器归零');
for(const [type,label] of Object.entries({xPosition:'X 坐标',yPosition:'Y 坐标',direction:'方向',spriteSize:'角色大小',mouseX:'鼠标 X',mouseY:'鼠标 Y',mouseDown:'鼠标按下？',touchingEdge:'碰到边缘？',timer:'计时器'}))define(type,'sensing',label,{}, {reporter:true});
define('keyPressed','sensing','按键按下？',{key:choice('按键','space',['space','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','ArrowUp','ArrowDown','a','d','w','s'])},{reporter:true});
for(const [type,label] of Object.entries({add:'相加 +',subtract:'相减 −',multiply:'相乘 ×',divide:'相除 ÷',mod:'取余数',random:'随机数',greater:'大于 >',less:'小于 <',equals:'等于 =',and:'并且',or:'或者'}))define(type,'operators',label,{a:v('左值',type==='and'||type==='or'?true:10),b:v('右值',type==='and'||type==='or'?false:5)},{reporter:true});
for(const [type,label] of Object.entries({not:'不成立',round:'四舍五入',abs:'绝对值',length:'文本长度'}))define(type,'operators',label,{value:v('输入',type==='not'?true:1.5)},{reporter:true});
define('join','operators','连接文本',{a:v('文本一','你好'),b:v('文本二','世界')},{reporter:true});
define('setVar','variables','变量设为',{name:nameField('变量','分数','variable'),value:v('值',0)});
define('changeVar','variables','变量增加',{name:nameField('变量','分数','variable'),value:n('增加量',1)});
define('variable','variables','变量的值',{name:nameField('变量','分数','variable')},{reporter:true});
define('define','custom','定义积木',{name:nameField('名称','小舞步'),parameter:nameField('参数名','步数')},{container:true,definition:true});
define('call','custom','调用积木',{name:nameField('名称','小舞步','procedure'),value:v('参数',60)});
define('argument','custom','本次调用的参数',{}, {reporter:true});
define('penDown','pen','落笔');define('penUp','pen','抬笔');define('clear','pen','清除画迹');
let sequence=0;
export const uid=()=>`b${Date.now().toString(36)}-${++sequence}`;
export function block(type,overrides={}){
  if(!Object.hasOwn(TYPES,type))throw new Error('未知积木');
  const d=TYPES[type],fields=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(d.fields).map(([key,f])=>[key,structuredClone(f.default)]));
  return {id:uid(),type,...fields,...(d.container?{children:[]}:{}),...(d.otherwise?{otherwise:[]}:{}),...overrides};
}
export const isExpression=value=>value!==null && typeof value==='object' && !Array.isArray(value);
export function expression(type,overrides={}){const {id,...value}=block(type,overrides);if(!TYPES[type].reporter)throw new Error('需要返回值积木');return value;}
